WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.770 align:middle line:90%


00:00:00.770 --> 00:00:01.530 align:middle line:90%
Hi, everybody.

00:00:01.530 --> 00:00:03.770 align:middle line:84%
My name is Ranger Connie
and I am reporting live

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:06.020 align:middle line:90%
from Grand Canyon National Park.

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:08.210 align:middle line:84%
And I am an education
ranger here.

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:11.090 align:middle line:84%
I pretty much give
programs and lessons

00:00:11.090 --> 00:00:13.090 align:middle line:84%
to students like yourself
from K through 12.

00:00:13.090 --> 00:00:14.840 align:middle line:84%
And that's one of my
favorite things to do

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:17.780 align:middle line:84%
is actually to teach the public
about these really beautiful

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:18.560 align:middle line:90%
places.

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:21.500 align:middle line:84%
And the second part is I get
to travel to different parks,

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:24.470 align:middle line:84%
like here I'm in the
Grand Canyon National Park

00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:25.940 align:middle line:90%
and now I'm here in Yosemite.

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:28.040 align:middle line:84%
So here I'm also an
education ranger.

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:29.840 align:middle line:84%
And I was actually a
teacher before this.

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:31.558 align:middle line:84%
I taught in Los Angeles
for seven years.

00:00:31.558 --> 00:00:34.100 align:middle line:84%
So it's been really awesome just
teaching here, leading field

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:35.720 align:middle line:90%
trips, doing virtual programs.

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:37.580 align:middle line:84%
And yeah, just
changing my classroom

00:00:37.580 --> 00:00:39.920 align:middle line:84%
from an actual
classroom, really small

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:43.960 align:middle line:84%
and enclosed to somewhere
as beautiful as this.